[09:55] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: Slide listing "Overvaluation at IPO" as a reason for Paytm's stock crash, with a declining stock graph in the background.
AUDIO: 'billion USD. The stock was priced at 2,150 rupees. On day one, it crashed 27% and kept falling.'

[10:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
